#### 796. 旋转字符串
(https://leetcode.cn/problems/rotate-string/)
```cpp
class Solution {
  public:
	bool rotateString(string s, string goal) {
		if(s.size() != goal.size()) return false;
		do {
			if(s == goal) {
				return true;
			}
		} while(std::next_permutation(s.begin(), s.end()));
		return false;
	}
};
```
记住即可

